                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "A fictional digital payments provider trains Payments Operations Associates in recurring cohorts. Leaders need to know whether each cohort is on track: who started, who is still training, how attendance and core competencies develop, and how cohorts compare at the same stage of the programme.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "11pt",
